msgstr "你可以在下方找到此模块中的所有可用函数。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:21 0a277c62cf324bb2bdaf2d6b041f395f
msgid "Bake Entity"
msgstr "烘培实体"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:25 9cb02d6c55b74e35bba57b4ed45c5a40
msgid "Bake an [entity's hitbox](#entity-types) to improve performance when its size never changes. If the entity has passengers, they are also baked, and the base entity's hitbox is expanded to include the full bounding box of the entire stack."
msgstr "Bake an [entity's hitbox](#entity-types) to improve performance when its size never changes. If the entity has passengers, they are also baked, and the base entity's hitbox is expanded to include the full bounding box of the entire stack."

