#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:31 498ce15a4ea441dfa30d7b2fae152761
msgid "**State**: The entity's hitbox is saved in a baked state for later use."
msgstr "**状态**：实体的碰撞箱将以烘焙状态保存，供后续使用。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:35 669452aa59704be48c389046eee7d2c3
msgid "Only use baked hitboxes when you are sure the entity's size will not change, for example: no growth (babies), no scaling, no new passengers, and no equipment that could affect size."
msgstr "仅在确定实体大小不会改变时使用烘烤碰撞箱，例如：无成长（幼年）、无缩放、无新乘客以及无可能影响大小的装备。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:37 35234095b3de4623b77acfade1292658
msgid "If the hitbox changes after baking, **it may lead to incorrect collisions or broken logic**."
msgstr "若碰撞箱在烘焙后发生变化，**可能导致碰撞检测错误或逻辑错误**。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 2662adbcedc84e84bc24c0a9f4fc5546
#: 901494d6f6794541ab5e7e61e20fc2df b76e31528b6243b5a883330c24c8fb5f
msgid "What is a Bounding Box?"
msgstr "什么是包围盒？"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:44 ../../modules/hitbox.md:400
#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:597 9f244f8906894744a02bd0cffe53bb55
#: ce74ef1354294683b0e4764f4589a6c0 fa8d8965105e4a31b14d9600f583f65c
msgid "A bounding box is a simple rectangular box that surrounds an object—or part of it—to help the game figure out where it is and what it touches. For example, a set of stairs in Minecraft uses two bounding boxes: one for the lower step and one for the upper step."
msgstr "边界框是一个简单的矩形框，围绕对象或其部分，以帮助游戏确定其位置和接触的内容。例如，Minecraft中的一组楼梯使用两个边界框：一个用于较低的台阶，一个用于较高的台阶。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 7d4db1967150459ead8275059ddac6b2
msgid "What is a Baked Hitbox?"
msgstr "什么是烘焙碰撞箱？"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:51 9c1175e39f404f33b3d44d00465e9b58
msgid "Baking captures a snapshot of the entity's hitbox at a specific moment. It does not update after that. If the entity has passengers, the baked result includes a bounding box that encapsulates both the base entity and all passengers."
msgstr "烘焙会捕捉实体碰撞箱在特定时刻的状态，此后不再更新。若实体运载乘客，烘焙结果将生成一个同时包容基础实体与所有乘客的边界框。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:53 ../../modules/hitbox.md:413
#: 083d51f8def542af995a2c395ae97e94 d15c2b79ffac40dbb9a7b08840d82f84
msgid "See [Hitbox Types](#hitbox-types) for full details on block and entity hitboxes."
msgstr "See [Hitbox Types](#hitbox-types) for full details on block and entity hitboxes."

