msgstr "方块"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 1f785720eabf43d8a3588b6c6263a3f0
#: dcc7ec0f2fb44807a38cde379421ca30 f6819c99ba67478ab8893a114f8bde32
msgid "Block Shape"
msgstr "方块"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:68 5c54ef7a01b54455be191a850327327d
msgid "Get the `default` shape of a block, represented by a list of box coordinates. This shape defines the area where the player can interact with or aim at the block. Coordinates range from `0` to `16` within a block space, as in block models."
msgstr "Get the `default` shape of a block, represented by a list of box coordinates. This shape defines the area where the player can interact with or aim at the block. Coordinates range from `0` to `16` within a block space, as in block models."

