#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:97 739e070d30104923bd0cecf256d9abd7
msgid "Get the `collision` shape of a block, represented by a list of box coordinates. This shape defines the solid boundaries of the block that entities cannot pass through. Coordinates range from `0` to `16` within a block space, as in block models."
