#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:357 eef8644f58aa4e4798edb1fe65a15c53
msgid "Reset an [entity's hitbox](#entity-types) to its default **dynamic** form, removing any previously applied **baked** or **custom** hitbox."
msgstr "将[实体的碰撞箱](#entity-types)重置为默认的**动态**形式，移除所有先前应用的**烘焙**或**自定义**碰撞箱。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:360 2c6e1a6070e84e28a5d7b5dc130a848e
msgid "**Execution `as <entities>`**: The entity or entities whose hitbox should be reset."
msgstr "**执行 `as <实体>`**：要重置碰撞箱的实体。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:363 32e6290daba741798e0bee0d1dedb5b1
msgid "**State**: The entity's hitbox is now dynamic again and will automatically update with scaling, growth, or other changes."
msgstr "**状态**：实体的碰撞箱现在再次变为动态，并将随着缩放、成长或其他变化自动更新。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:370 82daaf252aa94afa97859a31176a1a0e
msgid "Set Entity"
msgstr "设置实体"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:374 bdd3e72bbbbe4466ac67517699782590
msgid "Define a [custom hitbox](#entity-types) for an entity with full control over its dimensions. This allows setting a hitbox not constrained by Minecraft's built-in width/height system and can be used on entities that normally have no hitbox."
msgstr "Define a [custom hitbox](#entity-types) for an entity with full control over its dimensions. This allows setting a hitbox not constrained by Minecraft's built-in width/height system and can be used on entities that normally have no hitbox."

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:377 efe64c2c487d439c84f6fd7ec3d87d74
msgid "**Execution `as <entities>`**: The entity or entities whose hitbox should be set with custom dimensions."
msgstr "**执行 `as <实体>`**：要设置自定义碰撞箱尺寸的实体。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:379 e54b02f2d0574f9694d8113c85d4324e
msgid "**Function macro**:"
msgstr "**函数宏**："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:381 80e96d1bdea04bada1dd3b8381e8cab7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`compound` Arguments"
msgstr "{nbt}`compound` 参数"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:382 232791e4b97040958c4c67b3263ea7bb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`compound` **with**: Hitbox data."
msgstr "{nbt}`compound` **with**：碰撞箱数据。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:383 5e0c77e38d8a443685884ea21478213d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`double` **width**: The total horizontal size along the X axis."
msgstr "{nbt}`double` **width**：沿X轴的总水平尺寸。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:384 cd808eb5bb8d44558a21f15494869870
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`double` **height**: The total vertical size along the Y axis."
msgstr "{nbt}`double` **height**：沿Y轴的总垂直尺寸。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:385 aea9e9ba9a494e8ea2e9e1a1b2a32281
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`double` **depth**: The total size along the Z axis. Defaults to the same value as **width** if not provided."
msgstr "{nbt}`double` **depth**：沿Z轴的总尺寸。若未提供则默认与**width**相同。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:386 132c31a634d24083bd4348700db83ee0
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`bool` **centered**: Whether the hitbox should be vertically centered on the Y axis. Defaults to `false`, meaning the hitbox starts at the entity's feet (like in vanilla)."
msgstr "{nbt}`bool` **centered**：碰撞箱是否应在Y轴上垂直居中。默认为`false`，表示碰撞箱从实体脚部开始（与原版相同）。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:389 5fc9b6551256466f9d89a745032b42e8
msgid "**State**: The entity now has a custom axis-aligned bounding box (AABB) hitbox."
msgstr "**输出状态**：实体现在拥有自定义的轴对齐边界框（AABB）碰撞箱。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:393 56637e3f98ad437594f46b65bb30ff43
msgid "Custom hitboxes come with a **small performance cost**. Use them when you need precise control over shape and position, but avoid using too many of them in the same area."
msgstr "自定义碰撞箱会带来**轻微性能开销**。仅在需要精确控制形状和位置时使用，避免在同一区域使用过多自定义碰撞箱。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 8fb8edef72b141b489bd32a9c7d0d4ad
msgid "What is a Custom Hitbox?"
msgstr "什么是自定义碰撞箱？"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:407 8bcb3d140b2e4632bf90ed3acca3890e
msgid "A custom hitbox lets you override Minecraft's default hitbox system and define your own shape using width, height, and depth. Unlike dynamic or baked hitboxes, custom hitboxes:"
msgstr "自定义碰撞箱允许你覆盖Minecraft的默认碰撞箱系统，使用宽度、高度和深度定义自己的形状。与动态或烘焙碰撞箱不同，自定义碰撞箱具有以下特点："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:409 baa98bf256564234bfbfa862125450e7
msgid "Can be **freely shaped**, including along the Z axis (depth)."
msgstr "可**自由塑形**，包括沿Z轴（深度）方向。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:410 6ba8634b2c2f4b698a64d8930de31065
msgid "Are not tied to Minecraft's internal collision model."
msgstr "不受Minecraft内部碰撞模型约束。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:411 61b10d168bf24695b6f8ce48b203ae06
msgid "Work on entities **without a native hitbox**, such as display entities."
msgstr "适用于**无原生碰撞箱**的实体，如显示实体。"

