msgstr "**`#bs.hitbox:intangible`**"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:455 18f71a71ea384edaa9854cfae660300b
msgid "Blocks that cannot be physically interacted with, such as air variants, light blocks, and structure void."
msgstr "无法进行物理交互的方块，例如空气变种、光线方块和结构空隙。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 3cf4dc24ddac43a49af52b5553fc6f2f
