msgstr "是完整方块"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:460 1763b8d0e4944e0682814df6b55f2000
msgid "**`#bs.hitbox:is_full_cube`**"
msgstr "**`#bs.hitbox:is_full_cube`**"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:462 5d11215b57f944459f72f1e2680106a1
msgid "Blocks that are full 16×16×16 cubes."
msgstr "完整的16×16×16立方体方块。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:470 ../../modules/hitbox.md:537
#: 1db4c85b8f23422e89245a6497fde366 1eee518f0ae047e69015f0432026f6ad
msgid "Entities"
msgstr "实体"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:478 977b9367072043c287936897ba982263
msgid "Entities that don't act as physical obstacles, such as projectiles, markers, and displays."
msgstr "不充当物理障碍的实体，例如弹射物、标记和显示实体。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 8d3fde879c524ac68af7bdb7dbb403e4
