#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:485 5cc4a9c7855c48b5978e1ba5a486980f
msgid "Entities with different width and depth, such as paintings and item frames."
msgstr "宽度和深度不同的实体，例如画和物品展示框。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 79fb969e073e4e2bb2f11e06c4a1a870
msgid "Is Sized"
msgstr "有尺寸"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:490 d741aefa024b48838e94992af0b041a9
