msgstr "**`#bs.hitbox:is_sized`**"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:492 331083000cef4fec9a4ed47763f53aa9
msgid "Entities with equal width and depth."
msgstr "宽度和深度相等的实体。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:501 1d946fa6b9854346baac72b8f65129e6
msgid "🎓 Hitbox Types"
msgstr "🎓 碰撞箱类型"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:503 0265cda33d1941c09789d6a854e0ef12
msgid "Bookshelf provides multiple hitbox types, each suited to different use cases. Understanding the differences helps you choose the right one."
msgstr "Bookshelf 提供两种方块碰撞箱和三种实体碰撞箱类型，分别适用于不同场景。了解其差异有助于选择合适类型。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 59a51c5a03d84323b302cb72a28d8921
#: 63d04914f93541ddb3a502bff3d7affe
msgid "🖱 Default"
msgstr "🖱 默认"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:514 bf6cd4e0d72a49e896de980a3475d0fc
msgid "The `default` shape defines the area where players can interact with or break the block:"
msgstr "`interaction` 定义玩家可交互或破坏方块的区域："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:516 b0da69b8450e419cbb667c0aed337286
msgid "Specifies the zone where right-clicks, mining, or other interactions register."
msgstr "指定右键点击、挖掘等交互操作生效的区域。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:517 7c1cd0466501435caa234173ab10c648
msgid "Can differ from the collision shape, for example, fence gates keep the same default shape whether open or closed."
msgstr "可能与碰撞箱不同（例如：栅栏门无论开启或关闭都保持相同交互区域）。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:519 af5a159d94b24d0b84dde678dc390e4b
msgid "➔ Returned by [#bs.hitbox:get_block_shape](#get-block)"
msgstr "➔ 通过 [#bs.hitbox:get_block](#get) 返回"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 9778c1c3ce2e490d905351c44bac1c25
#: c1d5ce13a3d14fc993ed3074e73db216
msgid "🧊 Collision"
msgstr "🧊 碰撞"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:524 5236890371774757bf5490df04e34089
msgid "The `collision` shape defines the physical boundaries of a block that entities cannot pass through. It determines where an entity will stop when moving towards the block:"
msgstr "`collision` 定义方块阻挡实体通过的物理边界。决定实体移动至该方块时的阻挡位置："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:526 99bc2e3841eb457d90a5d56adc77b307
msgid "Matches the block's solid parts and prevents entities from moving through."
msgstr "鍖归厤鏂瑰潡鐨勫疄浣撻儴鍒嗗苟闃绘瀹炰綋绌胯秺銆"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:527 7cfc71374bac4883b605ec5ac62601a6
msgid "Can change dynamically depending on block state (e.g., a fence gate's collision shape differs when open vs closed)."
msgstr "可根据方块状态动态变化（例如，栅栏门在打开与关闭时的碰撞形状不同）。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:529 2d999060f0ea48dfa588f1a94673b416
msgid "➔ Returned by [#bs.hitbox:get_block_collision](#get-block)"
msgstr "➔ 通过 [#bs.hitbox:get_block](#get) 返回"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md ac7cbafed9624d5287f381bd79f33e1e
msgid "🔄 Dynamic"
msgstr "🔄 动态"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:543 550d35ddcf004f169d9e6a216422eea9
msgid "This is the native Minecraft hitbox, which updates automatically:"
msgstr "即 Minecraft 原生碰撞箱，自动更新机制："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:545 1c955d3c001e4ef7a505caab62492f3e
msgid "Adjusts in real time with entity changes like scaling, baby growth, equipment, or new passengers."
msgstr "随缩放、幼年体生长、装备或新乘客等实体变化实时调整。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:546 970f01e27ece44f7a959562c72dd9d95
msgid "No setup required, this is the default behavior."
msgstr "无需配置（默认行为）。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:547 dcfdbfde1b1c43fa8042f75e9675e80f
msgid "Use when the entity's shape is expected to change."
msgstr "閫傜敤浜庡舰鐘跺彲鑳藉彉鍖栫殑瀹炰綋銆"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:549 13685cbc368341bfbf64a863d014517e
msgid "➔ Restored using [#bs.hitbox:reset_entity](#reset-entity)"
msgstr "➔ 通过 [#bs.hitbox:reset_entity](#reset-entity) 恢复"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 7877e4474ff34e1fb82cacf6b328d518
msgid "❄️ Baked"
msgstr "❄️ 烘烤"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:554 76da846569034c869231d2727045243d
msgid "A snapshot of the entity's hitbox at a specific moment:"
msgstr "实体碰撞箱在特定时刻的状态："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:556 10a4aa17524a4d1487a3a20564c9c43f
msgid "Improves performance when the entity's size will never change."
msgstr "褰撳疄浣撳昂瀵告案涓嶅彉鍖栨椂鍙彁鍗囨€ц兘銆"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:557 cddbe4ddecc4425aa970820df7a8ed4e
msgid "Includes the base entity and all passengers in one combined box. When baking a pile of passengers, the base entity bakes all passengers and sets its hitbox to encompass the entire stack."
msgstr "包含基础实体及所有乘客的合并边界框。烘焙实体乘客堆时，基础实体会烘焙所有乘客并将其碰撞箱扩展至覆盖整个实体堆。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:558 12251b51d52b44429b5e9e5ac546da09
msgid "Does not update dynamically, collisions may break if the entity changes later."
msgstr "不再动态更新，若实体后续变化可能导致碰撞检测失效。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:560 c8f0392fdc24476ba39bd0c2d7606428
msgid "➔ Set using [#bs.hitbox:bake_entity](#bake-entity)"
msgstr "➔ 通过 [#bs.hitbox:bake_entity](#bake-entity) 设置"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md 2c0d886487dd46d3807f1bc8259f6cc4
msgid "🛠️ Custom"
msgstr "🛠️ 自定义"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:565 4b34adda0e0a4e95a3f371191f98c92a
msgid "A fully user-defined hitbox:"
msgstr "完全用户定义的碰撞箱："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:567 d5078e4f042242d68bc58e9e01d7c8e9
msgid "Set exact `width`, `height`, and optional `depth`."
msgstr "精确设置 `width`、`height` 和可选 `depth`。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:568 9f136ff6b90f434485794981d66e4823
msgid "Works on entities with no native hitbox (e.g. display entities)."
msgstr "适用于无原生碰撞箱的实体（如：显示实体）。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:569 1c45fbadb00743d9b516632fa62c3038
msgid "Independent from Minecraft's internal hitbox system."
msgstr "独立于Minecraft的内部碰撞箱系统。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:570 808ba38109b144e48a1162ed13c8722f
msgid "Only applies to the base entity. When used with modules that process entity stacks, only the base entity's hitbox is considered, passengers are ignored."
msgstr "浠呬綔鐢ㄤ簬鍩虹瀹炰綋銆備笌澶勭悊瀹炰綋鍫嗙殑妯″潡鑱旂敤鏃讹紝浠呰€冭檻鍩虹瀹炰綋鐨勭鎾炵锛堝拷鐣ヤ箻瀹級銆"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:571 815d1440a9954747a4e2d401d7cf2037
msgid "Slight performance cost, avoid overuse in the same area."
msgstr "存在轻微性能开销，避免同一区域过度使用。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:573 98678e013dec44c7ae1c0e57bfedfd48
msgid "➔ Set using [#bs.hitbox:set_entity](#set-entity)"
msgstr "➔ 通过 [#bs.hitbox:set_entity](#set-entity) 设置"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:580 b9da0a7975df42fd8b26b81da8f6769e
msgid "🔌 Hitbox Providers"
msgstr "🔌 碰撞箱提供者"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:582 36513a458fb34417bde0e0892a059e55
msgid "A hitbox provider is a callback that returns a block's shape for consumers such as [`bs.raycast`](raycast.md) or [`bs.move`](move.md)."
msgstr "碰撞箱提供者是一个回调函数，为诸如[`bs.raycast`](raycast.md)或[`bs.move`](move.md)这样的消费者返回方块的形状。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:584 8bc305b2fcbe44cb9fb0e574263f4f46
msgid "A provider can return one of two forms:"
msgstr "提供者可以返回两种形式之一："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:586 3ce00e20c6b148389def4ab580857145
msgid "**A single flag** (e.g., `return 1`), telling the consumer to treat the block as a full 16×16×16 cube."
msgstr "**单个标志**（例如 `return 1`），告诉消费者将该方块视为完整的16×16×16立方体。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:587 70484518e8104734bb4a27d1ead35309
msgid "**An array of bounding boxes**, stored in `bs:lambda hitbox`:"
msgstr "**一个边界框数组**，存储在`bs:lambda hitbox`中："

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:591 28b977e777004cdd802c074f9c6ea402
msgid "Each bounding box uses coordinates from 0 to 16, and may include a flag (defaults to `1` if omitted)."
msgstr "每个边界框使用0到16的坐标，并且可以包含一个标志（如果省略则默认为`1`）。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:600 efa9221c28ef46f08a634d3eb6a95c13
msgid "Flags"
msgstr "标志"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:602 5263977c5f7141f6aa48effea75d180e
msgid "Flags do not have inherent meaning. They are numeric labels used by providers and consumers to classify bounding boxes. You may use any of the following flags: `1`, `2`, `4`, or `8`."
msgstr "标志没有固有含义。它们是提供者和消费者用于分类边界框的数字标签。您可以使用以下任何标志：`1`、`2`、`4`或`8`。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:605 ffbf9f7f5de24bd79119c4916e271f94
msgid "For example the Bookshelf built-in providers use `1` for solid and `2` for fluids."
msgstr "例如，Bookshelf内置提供者使用`1`表示固体，`2`表示流体。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:610 bbd3b24f3384450680e4c01773b50a7d
msgid "Available Providers"
msgstr "可用提供者"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:612 5aa93c8a032e4bf38910feee3c13a695
msgid "All built-in providers include a fluid variant, where `1` represents the solid part and `2` represents the fluid part."
msgstr "所有内置提供者都包含一个流体变体，其中`1`表示固体部分，`2`表示流体部分。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:617 e8e33770f7fa4a3da65337cb054d8057
msgid "These providers return the block's **default** shape as defined in [block types](#block-types)."
msgstr "这些提供者返回方块的**默认**形状，如[方块类型](#block-types)中所定义。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:618 a0f070a59f604ff4bb79764a94a97a98
msgid "`#bs.hitbox:callback/get_block_shape`"
msgstr "**`#bs.hitbox:is_shaped`**"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:619 872e99d12ffc4bf2a6b88df3b7472484
msgid "`#bs.hitbox:callback/get_block_shape_with_fluid`"
msgstr "`#bs.hitbox:callback/get_block_shape_with_fluid`"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:623 6b551a2ccc98410e999d69ed1c17223e
msgid "These providers return the block's **collision** shape as defined in [block types](#block-types)."
msgstr "这些提供者返回方块的**碰撞**形状，如[方块类型](#block-types)中所定义。"

#: ../../modules/hitbox.md:624 08f3483f287f4069903d2274bdcfe502
